OL,3,GNEWSASalmonella outbreak: What we know
OL,4,Aso far
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe UK Health Security Agency (UKHSA)
OL,7,Fhas recently declared a national
OL,8,Foutbreak, external of salmonella food
OL,9,Fpoisoning after one person died and
OL,10,Fhundreds more fell ill with the bug.
OL,12,FAlthough not yet proven, imported eggs
OL,13,For dishes containing them are the
OL,14,Fleading suspects as to the cause.
OL,16,FEvidence also suggests people caught
OL,17,Fthe bug while eating out, rather than
OL,18,Fat home - with catering and food
OL,19,Fservices such as restaurants, cafes or
OL,20,Ftake-aways likely to play a part.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
